{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53915","headline":"悼盐官和尚（题拟《祖庭事苑》拟。《海昌胜蹟志》题作《悟空塔》） · 宣宗皇帝李忱","name":"悼盐官和尚（题拟《祖庭事苑》拟。《海昌胜蹟志》题作《悟空塔》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"像季何（一作「谁」）教祸所锺，释门光彩丧骊龙。\n香阶懒踏初生草，抵掌悲（一作「蕙帐愁」）看旧日容。\n玉柄永虽（一作「辞」）三教座，金鸣（一作「铭」）长镇万年踪。\n知师下界因缘尽，应（一作「却」）上诸天第几重？\n（见宋僧善卿《祖庭事苑》卷二。\n注「一作」者爲《海昌胜蹟志》卷一〖承陶敏先生告〗之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宣宗皇帝李忱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}